Description: Twenty progressive R and tidyverse koans designed by Colleen
    O'Briant, preserved in the isomorphisms/r-koans anthology. The exercises
    move from vectors and tibbles through dplyr, joins, ggplot2, regression,
    functions, purrr, lags, first differences, reduce, and accumulate.
